        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi oryakora ekyoterero ky'obubaane, okibaije omu munyinya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oburaingwa bwakyo kibe mukono gumwe, obuhango bwakyo nabwo mukono gumwe, kiingaingane embaju zoona, obwemi bwakyo kibe mikono ebiri, kandi amahembe gaakyo gabaiziranwe nakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okishwekye n'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, ahaiguru n'omu mbaju zaakyo n'aha mahembe gaakyo; kandi okiteho omuguno gw'ezaabu gukyehinguririze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okiheeshere ebifunga bibiri by'ezaabu, obite ahansi y'omuguno gwakyo aha mbaju zaakyo zombi, bibe eby'okutamu emigamba y'okukiheekyesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egyo migamba ogibaije omu minyinya, ogishwekye n'ezaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okite omu maisho g'omukingo ogukingiire eshanduukye y'Ebirikuhamya omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'okusaasira ekiri ahaiguru y'Ebirikuhamya, ahu ndiguma nimbugaabuganira naiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arooni aryayotereraho obubaane obw'emigaju erikutaamirana, abwotere buri kasheeshe, yaaba naashemeza amatabaaza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'omu mwabazyo, Arooni yaaba naahemba amatabaaza, abwotere, bube obubaane oburiguma nibwoterwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA obutoosha omu busingye bwanyu bwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 10:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mutarikyotereraho obubaane obw'ogundi muringo, n'obu kyakuba ekitambo ekyokize, nari empongano y'esaano; kandi mutarikishukaho empongano yoona ey'ebyokunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rimwe omu mwaka Arooni aheere aha mahembe gaakyo eky'okurihiirira; eshagama y'empongano ey'okurihiirira ekibi abe niyo yaarihiirira eryo itambiro rimwe omu mwaka omu busingye bwanyu bwona; n'ekirikwera munonga ahari MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 24:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.33.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 33:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 10:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku oribara Abaisraeli, buri muntu areetere MUKAMA eky'okucungura amagara ge omuri orwo rubaro, abantu batakaateerwa rufu noobabara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.17.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 17:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eki nikyo omuntu weena, ohikire kuza omu barikubarwa, ariha; ekicweka kimwe kya kabiri kya shekeli, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku erikwingana, (shekeli emwe neingana geera makumi abiri); ekyo kicweka kya shekeli kibe eky'okuhongyera MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buri muntu weena ohikire kuza omu barikubarwa, ohikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho, aryaha MUKAMA eky'okuhonga ekyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 10:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 1:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abatungi batarirenzya aha kicweka kya shekeli, n'abooro batarikicwaho, mwaba nimuha MUKAMA eky'okurihiirira amagara gaanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oryaiha aha Baisraeli efeeza ez'okubarihiirira, ozite aha murimo gw'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, zibeere Abaisraeli ekiijutsyo ky'okubaijukiraho omu maisho ga MUKAMA, okurihiirira amagara gaanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
